Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?test(nemesis):=20unmask=20and=20repair=20the=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?renderer=20test=20suite=20=E2=80=94=20163=20files=20/=201346=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?green?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Infrastructure:
- vite.config.ts gains a vitest test block: include only src/**/*.test.ts{,x}.
  Compiled .test.js siblings double-ran the suite and let stale artifacts fail
  fresh code, and electron/*.test.ts belong to node --test, not vitest.
- vitest.setup.ts polyfills CSS.escape for jsdom (timeline/cron selectors).

Test repairs (each verified against the commit that changed behavior; zero
source regressions found — every failure was a stale or buggy test masked for
weeks by the stale compiled-.js shadow):
- model-settings: mock lacked setApiRequestProfile; render wrapped in the
  app's shared QueryClient singleton.
- model-options + onboarding: explicit-providers change (37a4cf9000c) added
  request params the tests never learned.
- fallback-model: hostnameOf intentionally includes the pathname.
- streaming: Hermes→Nemesis loading-status string.
- attachments / pane-shell / use-preview-routing: latent test bugs (throwing
  getByTestId, missing resizable prop, persist-subscriber always writes '{}').
- artifacts / preview / right-sidebar / panes: student-build product decisions
  (web links excluded from Artifacts, single always-on right rail, persisted
  pane width).
- use-prompt-actions: session.resume carries source:'desktop' (ac6dd598a4b).
